// ============================================================================
// INSIGHT: CHEMICAL USE, from the chemical usage log (jugs issued, point-of-use barrel changes, returns, titration checks)
// ============================================================================
// Use is jugs issued + barrel changes, in gallons: the log's Gallons column (the hub writes it), else the amount when it is in
// gallons or ounces (ounces / 128). Rows in pounds (Boost Tread Defense) are added up apart, never as gallons. Returns are
